// "[Player] shuffles" [CR#701.24a]: randomize the cards in that player's
// library so no player knows their order. Lean `shuffle`; the basis carries the
// act directly, so the body is the constructor under the deed's own name.
// Its body's outermost identifier is the declaration's own name — an
// identity reconstruction of the native `Instruction::Shuffle` variant, so
// `semantics-v2-macro-param-kinds`'s collision refusal exempts it: reading
// `Shuffle(agent: X)` natively or through this macro produces the same
// value, so no rename is needed (unlike `Search`/`Vote`/`Exchange`, whose
// declarations carry no such identity body and so DO collide).
KeywordAction(
    name: "Shuffle",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "shuffle",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "shuffle",
        frame_set: Custom(
            frames: [
                [],
                [ObjectNounPhrase],
                [ObjectNounPhrase, Lex("Preposition", "Into"), ObjectNounPhrase],
            ],
        ),
    ),
    body: Shuffle(agent: Param(0)),
)
